sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant S as Spring (virtual thread)
    participant P as FastAPI (event loop)
    participant L as LLM
    C->>S: POST /consultations
    S->>S: save consultation, create job
    S-->>C: 202 Accepted + jobId
    S->>P: POST /v1/screenings (Idempotency-Key = jobId)
    P->>P: guard, mask, search (to_thread), reserve
    P->>L: await ainvoke (loop serves other requests meanwhile)
    L-->>P: JSON + usage
    P->>P: settle, post-checks, save
    P-->>S: report
    S->>S: job DONE, store report
    S-->>C: SSE "done" (or client polls GET /jobs/{id})
